<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">切换</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1" href="#1_Introduction" >1. 介绍</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2" href="#2_Potato_Raw_Material_and_Selection_Criteria" >2. 马铃薯原料及选择标准</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3" href="#3_Key_Deep_Processing_Products_and_Their_Production" >3. 主要深加工产品及其生产</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#31_Potato_Flakes" >3.1 土豆片</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#32_Potato_Granules" >3.2 马铃薯颗粒</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#33_Potato_Starch" >3.3 马铃薯淀粉</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#4_Industrial_Processing_Steps_Typical_Workflow" >4. 工业加工步骤 (典型工作流程)</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#41_Cleaning_and_Sorting" >4.1 清洁和分类</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#42_Peeling_and_Cutting" >4.2 去皮和切割</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#43_Blanching_Heat_Treatment" >4.3 热烫 &amp; 热处理</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#44_Drying_or_Dehydration" >4.4 干燥或脱水</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#5_Functional_Properties_and_Benefits" >5. 功能特性和优点</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#6_Applications_Across_Food_Sectors" >6. 食品行业的应用</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#61_Snacks_and_Convenience_Foods" >6.1 零食和方便食品</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-15" href="#62_Bakery_and_Confectionery" >6.2 面包店和糖果店</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-16" href="#63_Ready_Meals_and_Soups" >6.3 即食食品和汤</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-17" href="#7_Industry_Trends_and_Sustainability_Challenges" >7. 行业趋势和可持续发展挑战</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-18" href="#8_Quality_Assurance_and_Standards" >8. 质量保证和标准</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-19" href="#9_Conclusion" >9. 结论</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-20" href="#References" >参考</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-21" href="#Frequently_Asked_Questions" >常见问题解答</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-22" href="#What_is_potato_deep_processing" >什么是马铃薯深加工?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-23" href="#What_are_the_main_products_of_potato_deep_processing" >马铃薯深加工主要产品有哪些?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-24" href="#How_do_I_choose_the_right_potato_ingredient_for_my_application" >如何为我的应用选择合适的马铃薯成分?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-25" href="#What_are_the_benefits_of_using_potato_flakes" >使用马铃薯片有什么好处?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-26" href="#What_quality_standards_should_potato_deep_processing_factories_follow" >马铃薯深加工厂应遵循哪些质量标准?</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="226" data-end="248"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_Introduction"></span><strong data-start="229" data-end="248">1. 介绍</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="250" data-end="804">马铃薯深加工是指将新鲜马铃薯转化为食品制造行业使用的增值原料和产品的工业方法, 包括零食, 面包店, 方便食品, 和工业配方. 马铃薯因其丰富的淀粉含量而成为一种多功能原料, 功能特性, 以及在各种食品基质中的适应性. 由于对方便、营养食品原料的需求不断增长，全球马铃薯深加工产业持续扩张. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><p data-start="250" data-end="804"><a href="/zh/">访问我们的主页以了解更多信息</a></p><hr data-start="806" data-end="809" /><h2 data-start="811" data-end="863"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Potato_Raw_Material_and_Selection_Criteria"></span><strong data-start="814" data-end="863">2. 马铃薯原料及选择标准</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="865" data-end="1255">成功的深加工始于选择合适的马铃薯品种. 优选高干物质含量和低还原糖水平，因为它们会影响产品产量, 质地, 颜色, 以及加工过程中的风味. 还原糖含量低的马铃薯还可以减少热烫和干燥等热步骤中不必要的褐变. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="1257" data-end="1260" /><h2 data-start="1262" data-end="1321"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Key_Deep_Processing_Products_and_Their_Production"></span><strong data-start="1265" data-end="1321">3. 主要深加工产品及其生产</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="1323" data-end="1348"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="31_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="1327" data-end="1348">3.1 土豆片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1350" data-end="1690">马铃薯片是通过蒸煮去皮马铃薯而制成的脱水马铃薯颗粒或片材, 捣成浆状, 并使用滚筒或闪蒸干燥机进行干燥. 这些薄片重新放入水中后会迅速再水化, 使其对于即食土豆泥配方和配料混合物非常高效. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><p data-start="1692" data-end="1720">✔ <strong data-start="1694" data-end="1718">生产概况:</strong></p><ul data-start="1721" data-end="1950"><li data-start="1721" data-end="1819"><p data-start="1723" data-end="1819">清洗去皮→切块蒸煮→捣碎 / 精制→干燥→冷却→包装.</p></li><li data-start="1820" data-end="1950"><p data-start="1822" data-end="1950">根据最终用途规格，最终形状可能从颗粒结构到片状结构有所不同. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><p><a href="/zh/products/">去看看我们的产品</a></p><hr data-start="1952" data-end="1955" /><h3 data-start="1957" data-end="1984"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="32_Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="1961" data-end="1984">3.2 马铃薯颗粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1986" data-end="2253">马铃薯颗粒与薄片相似，但通常具有更均匀的球形或丸状结构. 它们广泛用于即食食品, 工业酱料, 和需要均匀水合特性的配方. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="2255" data-end="2258" /><h3 data-start="2260" data-end="2285"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="33_Potato_Starch"></span><strong data-start="2264" data-end="2285">3.3 马铃薯淀粉</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2287" data-end="2639">马铃薯淀粉是通过湿磨从清洗和粉碎的马铃薯中提取的, 沉降, 和干燥. 由于其优异的凝胶强度，它是一种主要的工业成分, 明晰, 和增稠特性. 淀粉的应用范围不仅仅限于食品, 包括可生物降解的包装, 粘合剂, 和药品. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.sohu.com/a/756598993_121123790?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">搜狐网</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="2641" data-end="2644" /><h2 data-start="2646" data-end="2702"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Industrial_Processing_Steps_Typical_Workflow"></span><strong data-start="2649" data-end="2702">4. 工业加工步骤 (典型工作流程)</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="2704" data-end="2779">现代马铃薯深加工生产线通常包括以下阶段:</p><h3 data-start="2781" data-end="2813"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="41_Cleaning_and_Sorting"></span><strong data-start="2785" data-end="2813">4.1 清洁和分类</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2815" data-end="2938">去除土壤, 石头, 和碎片作为预处理的一部分对于确保产品质量和设备保护至关重要.</p><h3 data-start="2940" data-end="2971"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="42_Peeling_and_Cutting"></span><strong data-start="2944" data-end="2971">4.2 去皮和切割</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2973" data-end="3131">土豆去皮了 (机械或蒸汽) 并根据产品规格切割尺寸. 例如, 切片为薄片或切丁为颗粒.</p><h3 data-start="3133" data-end="3171"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="43_Blanching_Heat_Treatment"></span><strong data-start="3137" data-end="3171">4.3 热烫 &amp; 热处理</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3173" data-end="3310">热烫可稳定可能导致变色的酶, 去除多余的糖分, 并为后续干燥准备内部淀粉.</p><h3 data-start="3312" data-end="3345"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="44_Drying_or_Dehydration"></span><strong data-start="3316" data-end="3345">4.4 干燥或脱水</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3347" data-end="3526">使用转鼓干燥或闪蒸干燥等干燥方法将水分去除至耐储存的水平，同时保留功能特性. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="3528" data-end="3531" /><h2 data-start="3533" data-end="3577"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Functional_Properties_and_Benefits"></span><strong data-start="3536" data-end="3577">5. 功能特性和优点</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="3579" data-end="3655">马铃薯成分在加工食品中具有多种功能优势:</p><ul data-start="3657" data-end="4047"><li data-start="3657" data-end="3746"><p data-start="3659" data-end="3746"><strong data-start="3659" data-end="3691">水结合和保留:</strong> 有助于保持烘焙食品和肉制品的水分.</p></li><li data-start="3747" data-end="3824"><p data-start="3749" data-end="3824"><strong data-start="3749" data-end="3773">纹理增强:</strong> 在再水合食品中创造理想的口感.</p></li><li data-start="3825" data-end="3945"><p data-start="3827" data-end="3945"><strong data-start="3827" data-end="3849">成本优化:</strong> 与新鲜土豆相比, 脱水成分降低运输和储存成本.</p></li><li data-start="3946" data-end="4047"><p data-start="3948" data-end="4047"><strong data-start="3948" data-end="3970">快速补液:</strong> 方便食品的关键. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="4049" data-end="4052" /><h2 data-start="4054" data-end="4096"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Applications_Across_Food_Sectors"></span><strong data-start="4057" data-end="4096">6. 食品行业的应用</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="4098" data-end="4138"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="61_Snacks_and_Convenience_Foods"></span><strong data-start="4102" data-end="4138">6.1 零食和方便食品</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4140" data-end="4337">马铃薯片和颗粒用于膨化零食, 即食土豆泥, 涂层零食, 还有更多. 它们的功能属性使它们在各种质地和配方中都具有价值.</p><h3 data-start="4339" data-end="4375"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="62_Bakery_and_Confectionery"></span><strong data-start="4343" data-end="4375">6.2 面包店和糖果店</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4377" data-end="4492">在面包店, 马铃薯成分可以改善面包屑的柔软度, 延长新鲜度, 并有助于营养状况.</p><h3 data-start="4494" data-end="4527"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="63_Ready_Meals_and_Soups"></span><strong data-start="4498" data-end="4527">6.3 即食食品和汤</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="4529" data-end="4691">即食汤, 准备好的饭菜, 脱水食品依靠马铃薯片来快速重构和稳定的感官特征. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="4693" data-end="4696" /><h2 data-start="4698" data-end="4753"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Industry_Trends_and_Sustainability_Challenges"></span><strong data-start="4701" data-end="4753">7. 行业趋势和可持续发展挑战</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="4755" data-end="5063">全球马铃薯加工行业正在扩张，但面临与能源相关的可持续发展挑战, 用水, 和废物产生. 新兴研究强调循环经济方法，例如对果皮进行增值和处理废物流以获取纤维或生物能源. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatonewstoday.com/2025/10/16/global-potato-processing-industry-faces-a-turning-point-study-maps-technology-gaps-and-sustainability-pressures/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">今日马铃薯新闻</span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="5065" data-end="5068" /><h2 data-start="5070" data-end="5111"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="8_Quality_Assurance_and_Standards"></span><strong data-start="5073" data-end="5111">8. 质量保证和标准</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5113" data-end="5338">深加工厂必须采取严格的质量控制措施，确保食品安全并符合法规. 这包括危害分析, 微生物检测, 并遵守标准化生产协议.</p><hr data-start="5340" data-end="5343" /><h2 data-start="5345" data-end="5365"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="9_Conclusion"></span><strong data-start="5348" data-end="5365">9. 结论</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="5367" data-end="5661">马铃薯深加工是一个成熟且不断发展的融合原材料科学的产业, 工业技术, 和食品应用创新. 随着对方便、营养成分的需求增长, 马铃薯原料在全球食品制造中的作用将继续扩大.</p><hr data-start="5663" data-end="5666" /><h2 data-start="5668" data-end="5698"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="References"></span><strong data-start="5671" data-end="5698">参考</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul data-start="5700" data-end="6540"><li data-start="5700" data-end="5771"><p data-start="5702" data-end="5771">作者(s). (年). <em data-start="5721" data-end="5743">文章标题</em>. 期刊/来源名称. 网址</p></li><li data-start="5772" data-end="6011"><p data-start="5774" data-end="6011"><strong data-start="5774" data-end="5812">马铃薯加工行业评论.</strong> (2025). <em data-start="5821" data-end="5920">全球马铃薯加工业: 生产回顾, 产品, 质量 &amp; 可持续发展</em>. MDPI. <a class="decorated-link" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="5928" data-end="5969">https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758</a> <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">MDPI</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li><li data-start="6012" data-end="6403"><p data-start="6014" data-end="6403"><strong data-start="6014" data-end="6062">全球行业挑战 &amp; 可持续发展.</strong> (2025). <em data-start="6071" data-end="6185">全球马铃薯加工业面临拐点: 研究绘制了技术差距和可持续性压力</em>. 今日马铃薯新闻. <a class="decorated-link" href="https://www.potatonewstoday.com/2025/10/16/global-potato-processing-industry-faces-a-turning-point-study-maps-technology-gaps-and-sustainability-pressures/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6206" data-end="6361">https://www.potatonewstoday.com/2025/10/16/global-potato-processing-industry-faces-a-turning-point-study-maps-technology-gaps-and-sustainability-Pressures/</a> <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.potatonewstoday.com/2025/10/16/global-potato-processing-industry-faces-a-turning-point-study-maps-technology-gaps-and-sustainability-pressures/?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">今日马铃薯新闻</span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li><li data-start="6404" data-end="6540"><p data-start="6406" data-end="6540"><strong data-start="6406" data-end="6430">市场产品用途.</strong> (2024). <em data-start="6439" data-end="6450">马铃薯加工产品现状</em>. 沼泽. <a class="decorated-link" href="https://www.sohu.com/a/756598993_121123790?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_new" rel="noopener nofollow" data-start="6458" data-end="6500">https://www.sohu.com/a/756598993_121123790</a></p></li></ul><hr /><section class="seno-faq" style="margin-top: 3rem;"><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Frequently_Asked_Questions"></span><strong>常见问题解答</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_is_potato_deep_processing"></span>什么是马铃薯深加工?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>马铃薯深加工是将原马铃薯加工成高附加值原料（例如马铃薯片）的工业转化, 颗粒, 淀粉, 和用于食品制造的纤维.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_main_products_of_potato_deep_processing"></span>马铃薯深加工主要产品有哪些?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>主要产品包括马铃薯片, 颗粒, 马铃薯淀粉, 和马铃薯纤维, 每个服务于不同的工业应用，例如零食, 面包店, 准备好的饭菜, 和酱汁.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_do_I_choose_the_right_potato_ingredient_for_my_application"></span>如何为我的应用选择合适的马铃薯成分?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>考虑吸水率等因素, 质地要求, 应用类型 (零食, 汤, 面包店), 以及您想要的功能特性. 建议查阅产品数据表和技术支持.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_benefits_of_using_potato_flakes"></span>使用马铃薯片有什么好处?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>马铃薯片提供快速补水作用, 质地一致, 以及工业配方的便利性. 它们通常用于即食土豆泥, 零食, 和方便食品.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_quality_standards_should_potato_deep_processing_factories_follow"></span>马铃薯深加工厂应遵循哪些质量标准?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p>工厂应遵守 ISO 等食品安全和质量认证 22000, FSSC 22000, 危害分析及关键控制点, 并定期进行微生物和化学测试，以确保产品的安全性和一致性.</p></div></section>`} />
